{"3478120":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Retro Jump","steam_appid":3478120,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro Jump is a platform game where you play as &quot;Ted&quot; the banana ambassador, whose mission is to recover the sacred banana. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To do this you will have to cross the entire country, 3 biomes and a castle. But this world, ravaged by war, is now populated by monsters, ghosts and whirring saws. You will have to jump, pounce on monsters, use springboard mushrooms, launch yourself from platform to platform to return victorious. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is colorful, with an &quot;Old school&quot; and retro theme, which will delight fans of the first platformers, as difficult as they are addictive. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to the classic levels, find: <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 scrolling levels<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Bananas to collect (to complete the game 100%)<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A “lore” tab to follow the story of the first opus of this universe<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Epic and retro musics<\/p><\/li><\/ul>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro Jump is a platform game where you play as &quot;Ted&quot; the banana ambassador, whose mission is to recover the sacred banana. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To do this you will have to cross the entire country, 3 biomes and a castle. But this world, ravaged by war, is now populated by monsters, ghosts and whirring saws. You will have to jump, pounce on monsters, use springboard mushrooms, launch yourself from platform to platform to return victorious. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game i